WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.200
Fade in.

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.220
Laurie Atkin.

00:00:02.220 --> 00:00:04.059
She was the first.

00:00:04.059 --> 00:00:06.690
Honored with a Scientific
and Technical Award

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:10.710
in 1961 for her
work at Technicolor,

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:14.880
Laurie was a scientist, artist,
a storyteller, a glass ceiling

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:16.980
breaker.

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:20.670
Cut to 2021, and Laurie's
pioneering legacy

00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:24.030
has become an expanding
story of women shattering

00:00:24.030 --> 00:00:27.750
what is possible in the science
and technology of filmmaking.

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:33.510
This year, Hayley Iben of Pixar
Animation Studios, Kelly Ward

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:38.550
Hammel and Maryann Simmons of
Walt Disney Animation Studios,

00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:44.310
will be the recipients
of the 24th 25th and 26th

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:46.980
Science and Technical
Award presented

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:49.380
to women by the Academy.

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:53.340
Hayley, Kelly, and Maryann are
honored for their innovations

00:00:53.340 --> 00:00:55.170
in hair simulation.

00:00:55.170 --> 00:00:56.970
And this year marks
the most women

00:00:56.970 --> 00:01:01.110
honored at a single Scientific
and Technical Awards.

00:01:01.110 --> 00:01:02.700
Is there work to be done?

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:04.349
More barriers to break?

00:01:04.349 --> 00:01:06.370
More progress to be made?

00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:08.070
Yes, of course.

00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:11.760
But the story of women
innovators making movie magic,

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:15.210
their story isn't ready to
fade out, not even close.

00:01:15.210 --> 00:01:18.900
Today more than ever, cinema
storytelling is science.

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:21.450
Cinema storytelling
is technology.

00:01:21.450 --> 00:01:25.260
And women are helping to
redefine science and technology

00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:26.640
in the movies.

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:29.580
And that means a
brave, bold future

00:01:29.580 --> 00:01:33.560
without limits for each
and every storyteller.

